     "It&#39;s probably happening after the print statement in that case. What&#39;s the step_vec thing? If it&#39;s discontinuous that&#39;s not going to work. And how are you getting such extreme values for the log-odds that you need to worry about (-20, 20)? <p>Jonah<br></p>"
    ]
   ]
  },
