   "subject": "Re: [stan-users] Why are there exceptions related to NaN values during sampling?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Thanks for the feedback, Jonah. I should have mentioned &quot;step_vec&quot;: basically it&#39;s a vectorized &quot;step&quot; function I defined which returns 1 if its argument is positive; 0 otherwise. The &quot;extreme values&quot; thing is just in case there might be samples resulting to such way-off log-odds. &quot;log_crit&quot; = 20. </div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Wednesday, June 29, 2016 at 7:23:01 PM UTC-4, Jonah Gabry wrote:</div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">If extreme values are a problem you can also try rescaling the data by constants.<span></span><div><br></div><div>Hope that helps,</div><div><br></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div>Jonah<br><br>On Wednesday, June 29, 2016, Jonah Gabry &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">jga...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">It&#39;s probably happening after the print statement in that case. What&#39;s the step_vec thing? If it&#39;s discontinuous that&#39;s not going to work. And how are you getting such extreme values for the log-odds that you need to worry about (-20, 20)?<br>\r\n<br>\r\nJonah<br>\r\n<br>\r\n--<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to a topic in the Google Groups &quot;Stan users mailing list&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this topic, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/topic/stan-users/Utko3usdzCg/unsubscribe\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/topic/stan-users/Utko3usdzCg/unsubscribe&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792461013144000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1KNbpVsiMpbigDLnuxR4C_\">https://groups.google.com/d/topic/stan-users/Utko3usdzCg/unsubscribe</a>.<br></blockquote></div></blockquote></div>"
