     1,
     "Hi Yaohui, <div><br></div><div>I think you probably don&#39;t want to be doing that. If everything is scaled reasonably it shouldn&#39;t be necessary and it introduces discontinuities that you want to avoid. Rescaling and using informative priors will help keep you from extreme values. </div><div><br></div><div>Jonah<span></span></div><div></div>"
