     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">​Thank you for your comments, Jonah. I resolved the problem. Basically I shouldn&#39;t calculate the division that way, but should use built-in function &quot;log1m_inv_logit&quot;, which is much more numerically stable.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
